            <ArticleTitle>Heterotopic bone formation causing recurrent donor site pain following iliac crest bone harvesting.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>476-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An unusual case of recurrent iliac crest donor site pain secondary to heterotopic bone formation is described. The literature is reviewed with a special emphasis on the aetiology and treatment of this entity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
